---
// Board packet figures are loaded client-side after getStaffToken() via GET /api/financials
// (YTD report + bank_statement + monthly_drilldown + donors). Do not import
// published_2026_ytd.json, statement_2026_08.json, monthly_drilldown_2026.json,
// or donor_database.json — Astro SSG would bake them into public HTML.
---

